### ==============================================================================
### AIC Rating 2.0 — Executable HTTP API Collection
### Compatibility: VS Code REST Client, JetBrains HTTP Client, Bruno, curl
### ==============================================================================

### Environment Variables & Placeholders
@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:3001
@aiBaseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8100
@aiInternalKey = test_internal_key

# Test credentials (prototype allows any non-empty test password)
@testUsername = qa.specialist
@testPassword = TestOnly#2026

# Known test entities seeded in prototype
@caseId = a06adf0c-7110-51f6-86ad-4b4b903c3e9e
@counterpartyId = 00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001
@docId = bdd9ea62-ce2f-5e12-b0d7-a7320811dea1
@sampleJobId = 00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000099

### ==============================================================================
### 1. AUTHENTICATION & SESSION MANAGEMENT
### ==============================================================================

### 1.1. Login (Specialist Authentication)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v2/auth/login HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "{{testUsername}}",
  "password": "{{testPassword}}"
}

### Capture session variables from login response
@sessionCookie = {{login.response.headers.Set-Cookie}}
@csrfToken = {{login.response.body.csrf_token}}

### 1.2. Verify Session & Profile
# @name getMe
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v2/auth/me HTTP/1.1
Cookie: {{sessionCookie}}

### 1.3. Logout (Terminate Session & Clear Cookie)
# @name logout
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v2/auth/logout HTTP/1.1
Cookie: {{sessionCookie}}

### ==============================================================================
### 2. CASES & EXPOSURE MANAGEMENT
### ==============================================================================

### 2.1. List All Cases (Paginated)
# @name listCases
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v2/cases HTTP/1.1
Cookie: {{sessionCookie}}

### 2.2. Get Single Case Detail (Includes documents, jobs, readiness)
# @name getCaseDetail
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v2/cases/{{caseId}} HTTP/1.1
Cookie: {{sessionCookie}}

### 2.3. Get Case Readiness Checklist (Blockers & waivable requirements)
# @name getCaseReadiness
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v2/cases/{{caseId}}/readiness HTTP/1.1
Cookie: {{sessionCookie}}

### 2.4. Get Case History Timeline
# @name getCaseHistory
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v2/cases/{{caseId}}/history HTTP/1.1
Cookie: {{sessionCookie}}

### ==============================================================================
### 3. COUNTERPARTIES (BORROWER / BUYER / SUPPLIER)
### ==============================================================================

### 3.1. List Counterparties
# @name listCounterparties
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v2/counterparties HTTP/1.1
Cookie: {{sessionCookie}}

### 3.2. Get Counterparty Detail by ID
# @name getCounterparty
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v2/counterparties/{{counterpartyId}} HTTP/1.1
Cookie: {{sessionCookie}}

### ==============================================================================
### 4. DOCUMENT UPLOAD & AI PROCESSING PIPELINE
### ==============================================================================

### 4.1. Upload Document to Case (Triggers Inspect & Extract pipeline)
### Required Headers:
###   - Cookie: Session cookie 'aic_fe_qa'
###   - x-csrf-token: CSRF token issued in login/session response
###   - idempotency-key: Unique client UUID for replay detection
### Form-Data:
###   - file: PDF binary (%PDF- magic bytes, max 10MB)
###   - expected_revision: Must match current case revision (Optimistic Concurrency)
###   - type: Declared document type ('contract', 'registration', 'financial_statement', etc.)
# @name uploadDocument
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v2/cases/{{caseId}}/documents HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundaryAICRating2026Upload
Cookie: {{sessionCookie}}
x-csrf-token: {{csrfToken}}
idempotency-key: aic-test-idemp-{{$guid}}

------WebKitFormBoundaryAICRating2026Upload
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="expected_revision"

1
------WebKitFormBoundaryAICRating2026Upload
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="type"

contract
------WebKitFormBoundaryAICRating2026Upload
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="valid_synthetic.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ../../tests/fixtures/synthetic/valid_synthetic.pdf
------WebKitFormBoundaryAICRating2026Upload--

### Capture Job ID and Document ID from upload response
@uploadedDocId = {{uploadDocument.response.body.document.id}}
@processingJobId = {{uploadDocument.response.body.job.id}}

### 4.2. Negative Test: Upload Malformed PDF (Triggers 400 INVALID_PDF)
# @name uploadMalformedPdf
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v2/cases/{{caseId}}/documents HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundaryAICRatingMalformed
Cookie: {{sessionCookie}}
x-csrf-token: {{csrfToken}}
idempotency-key: aic-neg-test-{{$guid}}

------WebKitFormBoundaryAICRatingMalformed
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="expected_revision"

1
------WebKitFormBoundaryAICRatingMalformed
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="type"

contract
------WebKitFormBoundaryAICRatingMalformed
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="corrupted.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ../../tests/fixtures/synthetic/corrupted.pdf
------WebKitFormBoundaryAICRatingMalformed--

### 4.3. Negative Test: Revision Conflict (Triggers 409 REVISION_CONFLICT)
# @name uploadRevisionConflict
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v2/cases/{{caseId}}/documents HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundaryAICRatingConflict
Cookie: {{sessionCookie}}
x-csrf-token: {{csrfToken}}
idempotency-key: aic-conflict-test-{{$guid}}

------WebKitFormBoundaryAICRatingConflict
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="expected_revision"

99999
------WebKitFormBoundaryAICRatingConflict
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="type"

contract
------WebKitFormBoundaryAICRatingConflict
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="valid_synthetic.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ../../tests/fixtures/synthetic/valid_synthetic.pdf
------WebKitFormBoundaryAICRatingConflict--

### ==============================================================================
### 5. JOB STATUS & ASYNC TRACKING
### ==============================================================================

### 5.1. Get Async Job Status (e.g. document inspection/extraction progress)
# @name getJobStatus
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v2/jobs/{{processingJobId}} HTTP/1.1
Cookie: {{sessionCookie}}

### ==============================================================================
### 6. DOCUMENT SOURCE RETRIEVAL & EXTRACTION DATA
### ==============================================================================

### 6.1. Get Immutable PDF Binary Source (For in-browser PDF Viewer)
# @name getDocumentSource
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v2/documents/{{docId}}/source HTTP/1.1
Cookie: {{sessionCookie}}

### 6.2. Get Extracted Fields by Document ID
# @name getDocumentExtraction
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v2/documents/{{docId}}/extraction HTTP/1.1
Cookie: {{sessionCookie}}

### ==============================================================================
### 7. FASTAPI INTERNAL AI SERVICE (Direct Internal API)
### ==============================================================================

### 7.1. Health Check
# @name aiHealthz
GET {{aiBaseUrl}}/healthz HTTP/1.1

### 7.2. Direct AI Inspection (PyMuPDF Native Page Count & Encryption Verification)
# @name aiInspect
POST {{aiBaseUrl}}/internal/v1/inspect HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
X-Internal-Key: {{aiInternalKey}}

{
  "schema_version": "1.0.2",
  "storage_key": "04_contract.pdf",
  "sha256": "33a453e3558ff0e8b5a770b70b38f2fb1bc32a2484cd3e916742ed973d378764"
}

### 7.3. Direct AI Field Extraction (Schema-guided extraction & grounding)
# @name aiExtract
POST {{aiBaseUrl}}/internal/v1/extract HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
X-Internal-Key: {{aiInternalKey}}

{
  "schema_version": "1.0.2",
  "document_id": "bdd9ea62-ce2f-5e12-b0d7-a7320811dea1",
  "case_id": "a06adf0c-7110-51f6-86ad-4b4b903c3e9e",
  "type": "contract",
  "storage_key": "04_contract.pdf",
  "sha256": "33a453e3558ff0e8b5a770b70b38f2fb1bc32a2484cd3e916742ed973d378764"
}
